            "value": "相機已就緒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't reach your phone. Keep it nearby with nope. open.": {
      "comment": "Watch warning: the paired phone can't be reached. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Dein Telefon ist nicht erreichbar. Halte es in der Nähe und lass nope. geöffnet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "No se puede conectar con tu teléfono. Tenlo cerca con nope. abierta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Impossible de joindre votre téléphone. Gardez-le à proximité avec nope. ouverte."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Impossibile raggiungere il telefono. Tienilo vicino con nope. aperta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "スマートフォンに接続できません。近くに置いてnope.を開いておいてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "휴대폰에 연결할 수 없습니다. 휴대폰을 가까이 두고 nope.를 열어 두세요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Je telefoon is niet bereikbaar. Houd hem in de buurt met nope. geopend."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Não é possível acessar seu telefone. Mantenha-o por perto com o nope. aberto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "无法连接你的手机。请将手机放在附近并保持 nope. 打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "無法連接你的手機。請將手機放在附近並保持 nope. 開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
